<p>Absolutely. Really, much like how joining this site doesn't enable literally anyone to be a writer, this tool doesn't automatically enable literally anyone to make a theme. There's more to it than just &quot;look at the tool and you'll come out with a good theme&quot;, and anyone needing this page will not only be interested in creating themes, but I suspect they'll also be more likely to make good ones too. You can't just have the tools; you need to know how to use them and what you're using them for, and what they'll look like in the end. So like anything else.</p>

